'''''Barbarea''''' ('''winter cress''' or '''yellow rocket''') is a genus of about 29 species of [[flowering plant]]s in the family [[Brassicaceae]]. Most are native to temperate regions of the [[Northern Hemisphere]], with the highest species diversity in southern [[Europe]] and southwest [[Asia]].<ref name = powo/> They are small, herbaceous, [[biennial plant|biennial]] or [[perennial plant]]s with dark green, deeply lobed [[leaf|leaves]] and yellow [[flower]]s with four petals.

